    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Battery",
            "text": "Remove the battery compartment lid by lifting upward.",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/MTGH1GGdFhFBjEaG.medium",
            "image_links": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/MTGH1GGdFhFBjEaG.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/APbvEr2QSp4KpTF4.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/TOoRScvG6KuJ452O.200x150"
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/100175/143974",
            "comment_links": [],
            "additional_images": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/APbvEr2QSp4KpTF4.medium",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/TOoRScvG6KuJ452O.medium"
            ]
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Next, the ribbon cable needs to be carefully removed from the back of the LCD screen.\nUse a plastic opening tool to press the black bar towards the ribbon and away from the white bar gently. This will release the ribbon.",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QEFalJjOQSBvQsAG.medium",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/100175/186626",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Remove the 4 M2x1.5-7 screws (7mm length) from the green PCB board.\nThis will result in two pieces, the back black cover and the PCB board.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/100175/186630",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "",
            "text": "The battery can then be popped out using precision [tweezers](https://www.ifixit.com/products/tweezers) and replaced with a new one.",
            "image": "https://cart-products.cdn.ifixit.com/cart-products/eQGTt3iN1MmOAQDy.thumbnail",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/100175/186632",
            "comment_links": [],
            "tool_used": {
                "text": "Tweezers",
                "url": "https://www.ifixit.com/products/tweezers",
                "price": "$4.99"
            }
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": {
        "text": "To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.",
